---
import DocsLayout from "@layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Search" description="Workspace search in Axon">
    <h1>Workspace Search</h1>

    <p>
        Axon provides fast, full-text search across your entire workspace.
        Search through files, find and replace text, and navigate to results
        instantly.
    </p>

    <figure class="docs-image">
        <img src="/media/screenshots/axon-screenshot-05.png" alt="Axon workspace search results modal with matching files and line context" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>Workspace search groups matches by file and lets you jump directly to the line that matters.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <h2>Opening Search</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Click the Search icon in the sidebar</li>
        <li>
            Use keyboard shortcut: <code>Ctrl+Shift+F</code> (or <code
                >Cmd+Shift+F</code
            > on macOS)
        </li>
        <li>From the command palette: <code>Search Workspace</code></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Search Features</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Case sensitive</strong> — Toggle case sensitivity</li>
        <li><strong>Whole word</strong> — Match entire words only</li>
        <li><strong>Regular expressions</strong> — Use regex patterns</li>
        <li>
            <strong>File exclusions</strong> — Skip node_modules, .git, binary files
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Replace in files</strong> — Find and replace across multiple files
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Search Results</h2>
    <p>
        Results are grouped by file, with line numbers and surrounding context.
        Click any result to jump directly to that line in the editor.
    </p>

    <h2>Quick Find</h2>
    <p>For searching within the current file only:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><code>Ctrl+F</code> (<code>Cmd+F</code>) — Find</li>
        <li><code>Ctrl+H</code> (<code>Cmd+H</code>) — Replace</li>
        <li><code>F3</code> — Find next</li>
        <li><code>Shift+F3</code> — Find previous</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Excluded Paths</h2>
    <p>By default, Axon excludes these directories from search:</p>
    <pre><code>.git
node_modules
dist
build
out
target
__pycache__
*.log
*.bin</code></pre>

    <p>You can customize exclusions in Settings.</p>
</DocsLayout>
